{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113100","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011310001:0":{"text":"전에 내게 준 의수도... 이런 덩굴로 만든 게냐?","source_cn":"你之前给我的义肢……也是用这种藤蔓做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DD6C3E8879FE59E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011310002:0":{"text":"맞아요! 급속 성장 덩굴은 튼튼하고, 빨리 자라서 숲에서 흔히 볼 수 있죠.","source_cn":"是啊！速生藤又坚韧，长得又快，丛林里经常能见到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A863B31C6D75F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011310003:0":{"text":"재료는 다 준비되었으니까, 이제 작업대로 가서 심혈을 기울여 만들어 볼게요!","source_cn":"这样原料就齐全了，现在回制作台，开始精加工！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F2DF325747A553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科林":{"text":"콜린","source":"科林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:达米安":{"text":"다미안","source":"达米安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}